{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026lnwqdve18p1793178369.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>張曦雯近日在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中展現亮眼演出，其演技與造型均備受各界關注。隨後，她在社交網分享了一系列美麗照片，並留言寫道：「Good mood is the best blush」，向粉絲傳遞好心情。</p><p><p><img alt=\"929eea1f-3f1b-417c-a436-d5a94ab5c42d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267S8feaSyUC1793178369.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"bbcf1b88-abb1-42c1-997b-6c522974586d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026pl8iyHxYGO1793178368.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>照片中的張曦雯女神氣場全開，她身穿一襲粉紅色荷葉邊露背長禮服，襯托出其高雅大方的女神氣質。面對鏡頭，她露出燦爛笑容，更在走廊中展現華麗轉身。整套造型極具美感，非常養眼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.767525+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:18:06.652330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:46.900536+00:00","content_hash":"f051a53c8177b0c73d7d3bc7227940d65b2c57b99bb225dc0075fa49a7922cf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.767525+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}